/* QubeC grammar: the source of truth for the lexical and syntactic grammar.
 *
 * Status: PROVISIONAL. The EBNF dialect is decided in M02. Until then this file uses
 * W3C-style EBNF (XML 1.0, Fifth Edition, section 6, "Notation").
 *
 * Each production will cite the decision that introduces it, in a comment: [Dnnnn].
 * The specification quotes productions from this file verbatim.
 *
 * No productions yet.
 */
